  Toggle Left Sidebar [CmdOrCtrl+B] disabled → send menu:toggleSidebar
  Toggle Right Sidebar [CmdOrCtrl+Shift+B] disabled → send menu:toggleRightSidebar
  Toggle Conversations [CmdOrCtrl+Shift+K] disabled → send menu:toggleConversations
  Cycle Preview Mode [CmdOrCtrl+Shift+P] disabled → send menu:togglePreview
