  Split Editor Right [CmdOrCtrl+\\] disabled → send menu:splitRight
  Split Editor Down [CmdOrCtrl+Shift+\\] disabled → send menu:splitDown
  Focus Next Group [CmdOrCtrl+Alt+Right] disabled → send menu:focusNextGroup
  Focus Previous Group [CmdOrCtrl+Alt+Left] disabled → send menu:focusPrevGroup
  Close Group [CmdOrCtrl+Shift+W] disabled → send menu:closeGroup
