  Quick Open [CmdOrCtrl+P] disabled → send menu:quickOpen
  Go to Line [CmdOrCtrl+G] disabled → send menu:gotoLine
Refactor
  Rename… disabled → send menu:refactor:rename
  Move… disabled → send menu:refactor:move
  Copy… disabled → send menu:refactor:copy
  ---
  Extract Selection to New Note disabled → send menu:refactor:extract
  Split Note Here disabled → send menu:refactor:splitHere
  Split by Heading… disabled → send menu:refactor:splitByHeading
