  Auto-tag disabled → send menu:refactor:autotag
  Auto-link outbound… disabled → send menu:refactor:autolink
  Auto-link inbound… disabled → send menu:refactor:autolinkInbound
  Decompose Note… disabled → send menu:refactor:decompose
